WEBVTT

00:00.580 --> 00:02.130
Ngoja tujikite kwenye

00:02.130 --> 00:04.480
zoezi ndogo kuhusu asilimia.

00:04.480 --> 00:13.820
Tujiulize wenyewe, ipi asilimia ya-- sijui,

00:13.820 --> 00:18.940
ngoja tuseme vipi kama asilimia ya 16 ni 4?

00:18.940 --> 00:20.600
Na nakushauri kusubirisha hii video

00:20.600 --> 00:22.830
na kujaribu kufanya mwenyewe.

00:22.830 --> 00:25.940
Ukiwa unasema asilimia ya 16 ni 4,

00:25.940 --> 00:29.520
asilimia ni njia nyingine ya kusema, vipi kama sehemu ya 16

00:29.520 --> 00:30.740
ni 4?

00:30.740 --> 00:35.330
Na tunataka kuandika hii kama asilimia, kama kwa kila 100.

00:35.330 --> 00:39.610
Kwa hiyo kama unasema sehemu ya 16 ni 4, unaweza kusema,

00:39.610 --> 00:43.150
vizuri, angalia, hii ni sawa na 4/16,

00:43.150 --> 00:48.380
hii ni sawa na 1/4.

00:48.380 --> 00:51.660
Lakini hii ni kusema sehemu 4 ni ya 16.

00:51.660 --> 00:53.449
Unaweza kusema, 4 ni 1/4 ya 16.

00:53.449 --> 00:55.240
Lakini hii bado haijajibu swali letu.

00:55.240 --> 00:58.116
Ipi ni asilimia?

00:58.116 --> 00:59.740
Kwa hiyo ili kuandika hii kama asilimia,

00:59.740 --> 01:03.360
kimsingi tuandike hii kama kitu chini ya 100.

01:03.360 --> 01:05.915
Asilimia ina maanisha "asili mia."

01:05.915 --> 01:08.820
Neno "senti" unajua kutoka senti na karne.

01:08.820 --> 01:10.550
Inamaanisha namba 100.

01:10.550 --> 01:12.419
Kwa hiyo ni kwa kila 100.

01:12.419 --> 01:13.960
Kwa hiyo unaweza kusema , vizuri, hii inaenda kuwa

01:13.960 --> 01:19.481
sawa na alama ya kuuliza chini ya 100, sehemu ya 100.

01:19.481 --> 01:21.980
Na kuna njia nyingi unaweza kufikiri kuhusu hili.

01:21.980 --> 01:23.980
Unaweza kusema , vizuri, kama kwenye asili

01:23.980 --> 01:27.990
kwenda kutoka 4 mpaka 100, natakiwa nizidishe kwa 25.

01:27.990 --> 01:30.970
Kwenye kiasi kwenda hapa -- natakiwa

01:30.970 --> 01:34.710
pia nizidishe kwa 25 ili kupata sehemu sawa.

01:34.710 --> 01:37.390
Kwa hiyo nitaenda kuzidisha kwa 25.

01:37.390 --> 01:40.720
Hivyo 1/4 ni sawa na 25/100.

01:40.720 --> 01:48.040
Njia nyingine wa kusema 25/100 hizi ni 25 kwa kila 100, au 25%.

01:48.040 --> 01:52.382
Hivyo hii ni sawa na 25%.

01:52.382 --> 01:53.840
Sasa, kuna njia nyingi

01:53.840 --> 01:55.450
unaweza kufikiri kuhusu hii.

01:55.450 --> 02:00.240
Unaweza kusema, 4/16, hii

02:00.240 --> 02:02.640
kimsingi ni kama 4 gawanya kwa 16.

02:02.640 --> 02:04.064
Vizuri, ngoja nigawanye

02:04.064 --> 02:05.480
na kubadili kuwa desimali, ambayo ni

02:05.480 --> 02:08.229
rahisi sana kubadili kuwa asilimia.

02:08.229 --> 02:10.780
Ngoja tujaribu kugawanya hii hapa.

02:10.780 --> 02:15.520
Tutaenda kugawanya 4 kwa 16.

02:15.520 --> 02:18.225
Sasa, 16 inaingia kwenye 4 mara 0.

02:18.225 --> 02:20.880
0 mara 16 ni 0.

02:20.880 --> 02:22.835
Unatoa, na tutapata 4.

02:22.835 --> 02:24.960
Na hatujaridhika kubakiwa na hii.

02:24.960 --> 02:30.560
Tunataka kuongza sifuri kupata jidu la desimali chini

02:30.560 --> 02:31.170
hapa.

02:31.170 --> 02:33.250
Hivyo ngoja tuweke desimali hapa.

02:33.250 --> 02:35.870
Tunaenda kwenye sehemu ya makumi.

02:35.870 --> 02:38.660
Na ngoja tuongeze sifuri hapa.

02:38.660 --> 02:41.190
Desimali inamaanisha tunazingatia kwamba

02:41.190 --> 02:43.398
sasa tuko kwenye makumi, na kwemye mamia,

02:43.398 --> 02:45.940
na kwenye sehemu ya maelfu kama tutaenda umbali huo.

02:45.940 --> 02:47.840
Lakini ngoja tuongeze 0 hapa chini.

02:47.840 --> 02:51.790
16 inaingia kwenye 40 mara mbili.

02:51.790 --> 02:54.975
2 mara 16 ni 32.

02:54.975 --> 02:57.160
Kama tukitoa, tutapata 8.

02:57.160 --> 02:59.960
Na utashusha chini sifuri nyingine.

02:59.960 --> 03:03.890
Na tuna 16 inaingia kwenye 80.

03:03.890 --> 03:08.630
Ngoja tuone, 16 inaingia kwa 80 mara tano.

03:08.630 --> 03:11.060
5 mara 16 ni 80.

03:11.060 --> 03:14.120
Tunatoa, hatuna kilichobaki, na tumemaliza.

03:14.120 --> 03:17.790
4/166 ni sawa na 0.25.

03:17.790 --> 03:21.570
Sasa, 0.25 ni sawa na mamia ishirini na tano.

03:21.570 --> 03:26.010
Au, ni sawa na 25/100,

03:26.010 --> 03:29.897
ambayo ni sawa na 25%.
